    {
      "name": "F1B-D-PLATFORM-USER-TOKEN-ACCEPTED — Personal user token minted by OUR issuer (ES256) is accepted by the edge → 200; its principal is a HUMAN, not a service account",
      "description": "class:AUTHN | class:CONF | class:FLOW | priority:P0",
      "item": [
        {
